{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike mining tower defense with endless build variety!</strong> Mazing, gem merging, roguelike perks, and physics-driven combat collide to create chaotic defenses and wild synergies. <strong>Gem Miner TD\u00a0</strong>puts you in the role of a crafty miner tasked with creating deadly mazes, combining powerful gems, and surviving relentless waves. Every run feels fresh, unpredictable, and filled with dazzling chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features - Why You Will Dig It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Maze\u00a0-</strong> Most TDs make you build around a path. In Gem Miner TD, you dig the path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge Gem System -</strong>\u00a0The Gems <i>ARE</i> the Towers. Discover over <strong>60</strong> unique gems. The more you merge, the more powerful you become!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Perks -</strong> Experiment with over <strong>80 </strong>Augments to stack buffs, enhance gems, empower your miner, or alter gameplay mechanics for a unique build every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability -</strong> With 4 unique maps, 9 Miners (classes), over 50 mob types, countless gem combinations, and powerful augments, every run is a fresh, exciting challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/9932953bcf1700471cf872f8a155d58c.poster.avif?t=1769434330\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/9932953bcf1700471cf872f8a155d58c.webm?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/9932953bcf1700471cf872f8a155d58c.mp4?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/5f552b964c8d7952872952a8f3b73cc2.poster.avif?t=1769434330\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/5f552b964c8d7952872952a8f3b73cc2.webm?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/5f552b964c8d7952872952a8f3b73cc2.mp4?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/ed015eaddbb75c99f2550dab8ec8c8db.poster.avif?t=1769434330\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/ed015eaddbb75c99f2550dab8ec8c8db.webm?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/ed015eaddbb75c99f2550dab8ec8c8db.mp4?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/02ab376a557716cbe4c102c2bda6befa.poster.avif?t=1769434330\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/02ab376a557716cbe4c102c2bda6befa.webm?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/02ab376a557716cbe4c102c2bda6befa.mp4?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, hard to master! Colorful pixel graphics, deep strategy, and endless replayability await. Climb the leaderboards, unlock the Vault to further customize your build, and push your limits in Endless Mode.\u00a0Are you ready to maze, merge, and survive\u2026 or get dragged into lava, freezing water, or maybe the poison pits?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.poster.avif?t=1769434330\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.webm?t=1769434330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A passion project over three years in the making, carefully crafted for endless fun and discovery. Join our Discord server!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835780/9cd80437a2c186de39917beb84a9c95ef2bad4ea.jpg"},{"name":"A Maw What?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835780/1820eadccad2cd37f877f1b0ab20980e7620b190.jpg"},{"name":"Arsenal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835780/c32c2cca61220a24a8a7c1dad75d82d35eea941a.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Education","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835780/83a201078e52550b229d3c9793fe8e0f801b5436.jpg"},{"name":"Doomcircle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835780/cac089e942cb0a0d4b91787d6bef8858359e229b.jpg"},{"name":"Enchantment V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835780/1331580fb695eea948d735b9293ed65d5e4f48a8.jpg"},{"name":"Hoarder","p